    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d32">

                <pb facs="0135" n="39" sameAs="frus:frus1900/pg39"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Townsend to Mr. Hay</hi>.</head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Legation of the United States</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Brussels</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1901-01-11"><hi rendition="#italic">January 11,
                        1901</hi></date>.</dateline>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 77.]</seg></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: In compliance with Department instruction
                    No. 62, dated December 24, 1900, I have applied to the Belgian Government for a
                    list of the signatory countries which have deposited their ratifications of <pb
                        facs="0136" n="40" xml:id="pg40"/> the convention of Brussels, June 8, 1899,
                    as well as a list of the States which have adhered since the signature of the
                    convention, with dates of adhesion.</p>
                <p>In reply to my communication on the subject I have just received from the
                    minister of foreign affairs a document, a translation of which I have the honor
                    to inclose herewith.</p>
                <p>I have, etc.,</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Lawrence
                    Townsend</hi>.</signed></closer>


                <xi:include href="d32-a1.xml" xpointer="d32-a1"/>
            </div>
